<h2 style="text-align:center">JEWELLERY CARE</h2>
<p class="sub" style="text-align:center">KEEP YOUR PIECES BEAUTIFUL FOR YEARS</p>
<p>Your Newds.Co jewellery is crafted with care. Follow these tips to keep your pieces looking beautiful for years.</p>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">GENERAL CARE</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>Keep pieces separate to avoid scratching</li>
<li>Remove jewellery before swimming, bathing, or exercising</li>
<li>Apply perfume, lotion, and hairspray before putting on your jewellery</li>
<li>Clean gently with a soft, dry cloth after wearing</li>
</ul>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">STAINLESS STEEL & GOLD PLATED</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>Wipe with a soft microfiber cloth to restore shine</li>
<li>Avoid harsh chemicals and abrasive cleaners</li>
<li>Store in an airtight pouch or box when not wearing</li>
<li>18K gold plating maintains its shine with proper care</li>
</ul>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">AVOID</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>Direct contact with perfumes and cosmetics</li>
<li>Sleeping with jewellery on</li>
<li>Excessive moisture and humidity</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top:16px">For a deeper clean, gently wipe with a slightly damp cloth and dry immediately. Do not use jewellery cleaning solutions unless specified for your piece type.</p>
</section>
